  WrittenDialogue: "Wait hold on!\nYou’re not my principal anymore I can go where ever I want.\nWhat are you in such a rush for?\nIn a rush to mind my own damn business, you should try it sometime.\nAwfully jittery,{1} running from something?\nNo dude I’m cool.\nOne of our faculty reported a stolen watch. {1}You wouldn’t know anything about that would you?\nWhat, you think I took his watch?\nHow’d you know their gender?\nFuck! Uh...{1}  I gotta run, entirely for recreational purposes.\nPerhaps a puzzle could satisfy your recreational needs? They’re quite the fad these days.\nBitch leave me alone!\nWhy don’t you pull your phone out for a game?{1} We need to have a little talk.\nAbout?\nThat missing watch of course, I hear it was very nice.\nI wonder if he was honest about how he lost it.\nIn due time.\nYou will not like the answer.\nWould you know what that answer is?\nNo I don’t know shit about that watch. Okay let’s play.\nGladly."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "PRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN\nEMILY\nPRINCIPAL LYNN"
